    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3ab506b32f1bd7b",
      "translationZh": "我们有四台 Sparks，组成两对 ConnectX-7 配对设备。过去一周，我们试用了 DeepSeek V4 Flash、Qwen3.8 Flash Next、Qwen3.8-27B 和 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B。以下表格是我们留存的本地测试结果，而不是从模型卡中抄来的估算值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "263c4773415964c8",
      "translationZh": "配置方案与上下文汇总",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "411e9633188cfc05",
      "translationZh": "模型 / 配置方案 硬件 运行时 / 加速 提供服务的上下文长度 已验证的最长提示 活跃路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d1d7adcb13e28e9",
      "translationZh": "vLLM、NVFP4 MLA KV、DSpark MTP5 概率式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e019b7a3c7e03cc4",
      "translationZh": "250,000 在较慢的无 NEXTN 配置方案上通过测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbbb52e15ab12189",
      "translationZh": "基准测试提示词；接近上限的长时间稳定性测试尚待进行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca90f7c6210e812a",
      "translationZh": "每个副本 8 / TP2 下有效值为 12",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e55b8b66e9753a5",
      "translationZh": "本次本地试验使用了 12 道 LCB_generation 问题和 12 道 coding_completion 问题，采用四个并发 API 请求、流式输出、不使用工具，并使用同一个禁用网络的执行评分器。这不是一次正式的 LiveBench 提交。实际交付 tok/s 为 API 统计的输出 token 数除以整批任务的实际耗时，其中包括预填充、调度、推理及尾部失败耗时，而非仅解码阶段的速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eef11a81c964578d",
      "translationZh": "模型 / 思考 得分 API 成功情况 实际耗时 输出 token 数 实际交付 tok/s 任务耗时中位数 最差任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8b886602f97cbca",
      "translationZh": "记录为 56,339；实际约为 89K",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2af41f60e67f263",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 Flash Next — 关闭",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4423429612ae0a1",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 Flash Next — 低",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7754b283e3984757",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8 Flash Next — 中等",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "60cff2bc41365075",
      "translationZh": "DeepSeek V4 Flash — 高",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d3980cc5e755336",
      "translationZh": "实际使用中的经验比单次运行的分数差异更明确：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39dba7122ae69d84",
      "translationZh": "Flash Next 的 medium 档取得了观测到的最高分，22/24。low 档则是更适合日常使用的平衡选择，得分为 21/24。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "867493bdce4bb7ac",
      "translationZh": "Flash Next 的 off 档完成整批任务的速度最快，回答也极其简洁。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d39bb95dfabd6c4f",
      "translationZh": "Qwen27 的 low 档以 3.82x 的实际耗时换来了多通过一项测试，而且有一次响应触及了其 32K 上限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d99b1b4330141c98",
      "translationZh": "DeepSeek 的 low 档生成的输出 token 数是 Qwen27 的 low 档的 2.65x，耗时 25 分钟。保留它的理由是另行验证过的约 900K 提示词处理能力，而不是它在这次测试中的速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0cbec27e0811b30",
      "translationZh": "High/xhigh 思考在这里明显适得其反。Flash Next xhigh 使用的输出 token 数超过 medium 的 3 倍，得分却更低；DeepSeek high 的表现还要更差。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a9da9d69a5326a8",
      "translationZh": "我们此前还在一个单独的 RTX 4090 FP8 端点上测试了 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B：它在 c1 时达到 118.12 tok/s，在 c16 时总吞吐量达到 784.68，服务提供的上下文仅为 32K。在一个可比的、包含 12 项任务的完整程序子集上，关闭思考时它得分为 11/12；low 思考同样得分为 11/12，但使用的 token 数是前者的 7.84 倍。由于任务数量和硬件均不同，该行未纳入包含 24 项任务的表格。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d8177e2a472393a",
      "translationZh": "这些都是实测结果，但不同原生配置测试的提示形式和输出长度有所不同。它们是有用的部署运行点，而不是一份统一按架构归一化的排行榜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13b9960e4c358c6c",
      "translationZh": "模型 / 拓扑 单流结果 C4 总吞吐量 C6/C8 总吞吐量 最佳有效饱和点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d372ecc964c3fa82",
      "translationZh": "强制可预测解码：79.4 tok/s；自由形式 512：42.08",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7412f868fdeb19fb",
      "translationZh": "c6 时为 99.26；c8 时为 89.81，有两个请求排队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e3858bea236101c",
      "translationZh": "65.51 代码 / 31.93 散文 ndec；27.02 固定-256 测试框架",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af04c0411af8bf56",
      "translationZh": "100.08 代码 / 47.06 散文 ndec；39.29 固定-256 测试框架",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96c77dd85391363f",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B，2 个独立副本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88439eb92a49eb86",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.6-35B-A3B，1 台 Spark",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "794a6aeb9158cafb",
      "translationZh": "对于 Flash Next，禁用 NEXTN 后，c1 下的速度为 26.4 tok/s，c6 下的总吞吐量为 111.8 tok/s。在当前固定-512 工作负载下，NEXTN 将单流速度提升至约 1.9 倍，将 c6 吞吐量提升至约 1.65 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a79fbc216202db0e",
      "translationZh": "DeepSeek 宣传的约 80 tok/s 可以复现，但仅限于推测接受率较高、可预测的强制输出场景。同样的实际运行配置在开放式自由输出上达到了 42 tok/s。只报告 80，在技术上虽属实，在实际使用层面却会造成误导。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "61c91af5c5e1475a",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B 拓扑测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e140f7adec0017e2",
      "translationZh": "下方所有行均在关闭思考的情况下生成了 256 个 token：",
